  "decision": "Measure actual indexed payload costs first, especially normalized per-facet AST presentation. Then supply a versioned bound provider view that visibly renders selected source while retaining canonical evidence locally and exact replay. Optional CLI guidance alone is not a source-rendering experiment; rendering and deduplication remain distinct changes.",
